  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia: Forests, Communities &amp; Sustainable Growth (Territorios Forestales Sostenibles)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To stabilise the deforestation frontier in the areas of Colombia most acutely threatened by deforestation and affected by conflict, by improving land systems and usage rights, building capacity to effectively tackle environmental crime, and promoting sustainable forest livelihoods and enterprises.

The programme was transferred from BEIS (now DESZN) to FCDO in April 2022. All previous annual reports and other relevant results are shown in the DESNZ dev tracker website here: https://devtracker.fcdo.gov.uk/programme/GB-GOV-13-ICF-0039-ForTREES/summary</narrative>
  </description>
